WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:03.483
Unit thirteen. Why Tobacco Harms!

2
00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:08.362
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.412 --> 00:00:11.535
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:15.157
Today we learn about Why Tobacco Harms. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.023 --> 00:00:19.490
Tobacco. Say it with me. Tobacco!

6
00:00:23.008 --> 00:00:26.674
Nicotine. Say it with me. Nicotine!

7
00:00:30.135 --> 00:00:33.235
Tar. Say it with me. Tar!

8
00:00:36.721 --> 00:00:40.688
Carbon monoxide. Say it with me. Carbon monoxide!

9
00:00:44.226 --> 00:00:47.276
Cancer. Say it with me. Cancer!

10
00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:54.590
Heart disease. Say it with me. Heart disease!

11
00:00:58.145 --> 00:01:01.445
Addiction. Say it with me. Addiction!

12
00:01:04.913 --> 00:01:07.946
Quit. Say it with me. Quit!

13
00:01:11.425 --> 00:01:20.877
Tobacco smoke contains nicotine, tar, and carbon monoxide. It causes cancer and heart disease. Nicotine addiction makes it hard to quit, so it is best never to start.

14
00:01:20.927 --> 00:01:23.777
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.211 --> 00:01:30.343
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.393 --> 00:01:31.543
Tar!

17
00:01:32.462 --> 00:01:37.669
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.719 --> 00:01:38.869
Addiction!

19
00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:46.057
Did you know? Tobacco kills more than 8 million people a year worldwide, according to the WHO!

20
00:01:46.107 --> 00:01:48.034
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.748 --> 00:01:56.246
Think and answer. Name two diseases caused by smoking.

22
00:01:56.296 --> 00:01:57.446
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.603 --> 00:02:03.197
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.247 --> 00:02:05.781
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

